1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,770
Microsoft is shutting down To Do, its task-manager

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:05,350
app, after nearly 10 years

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,250
The company says the shutdown takes place on

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:12,010
June 30, 2027, across Windows, Mac, Android

5
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:13,690
iOS and the web

6
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:16,210
Existing tasks and lists will not migrate to

7
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:19,910
Microsoft Planner, the new home for work and school tasks

8
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:22,290
Planner is not available on personal accounts

9
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:26,150
including Microsoft 365 Personal and Family subscribers

10
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:27,330
They will need another app

11
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:30,170
Microsoft says it will offer an export option

12
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:32,690
but has not yet published the details

13
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:35,010
The underlying To Do service and APIs will

14
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:38,210
be retired separately, at a date not yet disclosed

15
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:40,850
For Gulf companies running on Microsoft tools

16
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,250
watch how smoothly teams move their task data

17
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:44,050
before the deadline
